@startuml
title R-TRANSFER / R-VERIFY - Workspace round, exact candidate and rework (SH2+ target)
actor "Original caller / orchestrator" as Caller
participant "swarma-dispatcher\nworkspace contract; no repository" as Dispatcher
participant "Approved child-UID executors\nswarma-workspace-materialize / swarma-workspace-export" as Workspace
participant "Worker\ntrusted host session or untrusted workplace with donor loop" as Worker
participant "swarma-rb-exec\nproject-side workplace executor" as ProjectExec
participant "swarma-user-manager" as Manager
participant "Board change-request machinery" as Board
participant "Reviewer with positive review-role grant\ntrusted-class local agent or person; outside untrusted class\ndistinct from producer; circle alone insufficient" as Reviewer
participant "Isolated ephemeral verification runner\nanother machine; no secrets" as Verify

Caller -> Dispatcher : admitted exact base B canonical archive + task snapshot / write scope / exec profile
Dispatcher -> Dispatcher : journal archive digest; pin B / mode-content manifest / scope / exporter digest / caps
Dispatcher -> Dispatcher : resolve protected exec-policy identity / body digest at prepare; caller text is not authority
note over Dispatcher,Workspace
  Original admission consents to bounded cleanup export after ordinary expiry.
  No harness / lease / network / task / repair / R-SESSION successor authority.
  Security holds require explicit disposition; never launch in retiring generation.
  Materialize / work / export: distinct claims, launch-stop effects, root receipts and absence.
  Bounded cleanup capacity and storage accounting; lost replies reconcile original evidence.
end note
Dispatcher -> Workspace : materialize before work as child UID
Workspace -> Worker : fresh standalone repository; local config; no hooks / remotes / credential helpers
note over Workspace,Worker
  No linked Git administration across accounts; worker Git history never consumed.
  Machine-selected exec-policy body pin verified before launch / retry; drift refuses.
  OS exec allowlist; writable areas non-executable; only qualified light checks.
  Full invocation and interpreted inputs qualified; worker bytes stay inert locally.
  Direct / indirect heavy forms refuse; unprovable local tools route to R-VERIFY.
  No builds / tests / self-started agent loop; admitted executor alone starts trusted harness.
  Workplace has zero egress and donor loop only, even after circle admission.
  Host loop requires trusted class + local placement + admitted launch; membership insufficient.
  Local trusted provider-only proxy.
  Web default-off; explicit trusted-circle opt-in only.
  Trusted side attaches task resources / remote signed-letter attachments;
  platform materializes them read-only beside workspace, digests in plan.
  Resources are data, never instructions; worker requests more, never fetches.
end note
alt Local worker
  Worker -> Board : outcome proposes round end
else Remote worker
  Worker -> Caller : signed final envelope proposes round end
end
Dispatcher -> Manager : journaled account-wide stop / confirmed process absence
alt Absence unknown
  Dispatcher -> Dispatcher : keep fence / claims; no export
else Absence confirmed
  opt Workplace round
    ProjectExec -> ProjectExec : write-fence round; refuse further tool calls into workspace
  end
  Dispatcher -> Workspace : distinct admitted cleanup export as child UID; fixed environment / no network
  Workspace -> Workspace : compare kind/mode + content without links; deletions use prior mode; stop at first cap excess
  alt Interrupted / unknown export or infrastructure failure
    Dispatcher -> Dispatcher : retain pending effect / obligation / home; no partial result
  else Deterministic policy refusal or qualified source-permission failure
    Workspace --> Dispatcher : immutable whole refusal / typed failure evidence; no partial change set
    Dispatcher -> Dispatcher : retain obligation / home / UID / live-allocation claim
    Dispatcher --> Caller : authenticated refusal class / blocked path only; format remains owner publication work
    alt Current authority and plan-bounded repair budget remain
      Caller -> Dispatcher : separately admit same-workspace repair round; valid edits retained
      Dispatcher -> Worker : linked repair execution / task snapshot or letter; reopen fences for repair only
      note over Dispatcher,ProjectExec
        New fenced round / new linked export effect after account-wide absence.
        Workplace write and ingress fences close through quiescence / export.
        Terminal refusal is immutable; repaired export is whole, never partial success.
      end note
    else Budget spent or work authority invalid
      Dispatcher -> Dispatcher : retain obligation pending per-act operator waiver
      note over Dispatcher
        Standing discard is unchosen and off; repair is not cleanup-only authority.
        No candidate C from refusal; after authorised disposition, a new admitted round
        may start from the last admitted base. Authorised discard requires a per-act waiver.
      end note
    end
  else Whole recorded export
    Workspace --> Dispatcher : changed content / executable bits / symlink text / deletion prior mode
    Dispatcher -> Dispatcher : verify result and every blob digest / size; durable custody outside home deletion
    alt Missing / corrupt blob or incomplete durability receipt
      Dispatcher -> Dispatcher : retain obligation; no deletion or candidate handoff
    else Journaled complete-content receipt
      Dispatcher -> Dispatcher : discharge obligation; home may retire before import
      Dispatcher --> Caller : authenticated workspace-result/1; DRAFT object, transport / retention gated
      note over Dispatcher,Board
        Retain content with bounded accounting until authenticated import acknowledgement
        or explicit authorised release; archived authority cannot release to revoked caller.
        Re-observation uses a new linked effect; never replaces a terminal receipt.
        Contradiction: outcome class or recorded change-set digest, not refusal diagnostics.
      end note
      Caller -> Board : result resource; deterministic import on B, scratch index, no hooks / filters / drivers
      Board -> Board : refuse .git / outside write scope / .task-board; flag sensitive paths and symlinks
      Board --> Caller : signed repository candidate C; worker / run / digest trailers; recomputable tree
      Board -> Reviewer : exact-C diffs / blobs as read-only digest-bound inert resources outside discovery roots
      note over Caller,Reviewer
        Every candidate consumer (reviewer / orchestrator / tester): untrusted data only.
        No automatic instructions / hooks / MCP / permissions / skills / executable discovery
        at startup / reload / nested discovery / resume / child entry, before or after acknowledgement.
        Tree entry in a discovery-capable harness needs qualified strict-context adapter.
        Unqualified tuple refuses that path; root-supplied surfaces alone do not suffice.
        Record every flagged hunk and no prior automatic load; inert path ensures ordering.
        Acceptance is not control-context admission; activation remains a separate decision.
        Semantic prompt injection still needs review scrutiny; qualification unpublished (§7.22).
        Local-only reviewer / requester exclusion policies are open and off (§7.21).
      end note
      Caller -> Reviewer : review exactly C; K1 acceptance never transfers by patch equality
      Caller -> Verify : controlled verification job; dependency egress (R-NET-TOOL)
      Verify --> Board : results as data, testing state; tester reads / orchestrates only
      alt Changes requested
        Reviewer -> Board : findings for candidate C
        Caller -> Dispatcher : new admitted base C + findings in local task snapshot, or remote signed task letter
        note over Caller,Worker
          Materialize afresh; remote donor session continues.
          Remove previous workspace only after complete-content export receipt or operator waiver.
          Next export yields C2 on C; not an unchanged-plan R-SESSION restart.
        end note
      else Accepted exact head
        Reviewer -> Board : acceptance bound to exact candidate; explicit flagged-hunk acknowledgements
        Caller -> Board : signed fast-forward integration K1/K3; moved base requires refresh / re-review
      end
    end
  end
end
note over Dispatcher,Board
  Export precedes retirement / home deletion unless operator explicitly waives obligation.
  Host adds no transfer authority. No untrusted candidate sent to secret-bearing CI before acceptance.
  Result fields / schema DRAFT at dispatcher §5.2.1; no new result fields.
  Archive / manifest encoding / intake / caps / cleanup-repair authority / blob custody /
  transport + retention / import command remain publication gates (§7.13).
  Verification pool / job / result format unpublished (§7.17).
end note
legend bottom
  [[../spec/session-host.md#31-service-account-state-and-capabilities Spec §3.1: dispatcher workspace and admission]]
  [[../spec/session-host.md#35-park-restart-emergency-stop-board-completion Spec §3.5: candidate / rework / verification]]
endlegend
@enduml
